      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scene Graph\n─────────────────\nScene\n├─ SkyDome\n│   └─ ShaderMaterial\n│       ├─ 渐变 (smoothstep)\n│       └─ FBM 云朵噪声\n├─ fillMesh  ← Mesh\n│   └─ MeshBasicMaterial\n│       └─ color #dde8f8\n├─ plane  ← LineSegments\n│   └─ LineBasicMaterial\n│       └─ color #88b0d8\n└─ UI Sprites\n    └─ PlaneGeometry ×3\n        └─ MeshBasicMaterial\n            └─ map: texture",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scene Graph\n─────────────────\nScene\n├─ SkyDome\n│   └─ ShaderMaterial\n│       ├─ 渐变 (smoothstep)\n│       └─ FBM 云朵噪声\n├─ fillMesh  ← Mesh\n│   └─ MeshBasicMaterial\n│       └─ color #dde8f8\n├─ plane  ← LineSegments\n│   └─ LineBasicMaterial\n│       └─ color #88b0d8\n└─ UI Sprites\n    └─ PlaneGeometry ×3\n        └─ MeshBasicMaterial\n            └─ map: texture"
    },

